Station H-07 (Survey Area H) consists of a six-layer model. The resistivity starts at 1790.5 ohm-m and decreases through the first three layers to a minimum of 73.0 ohm-m. Resistivity then increases to 540.2 ohm-m in layer 5, before decreasing slightly to 520.8 ohm-m in layer 6.

The current classification on file for this station is QHAA-type. However, this does not match the provided resistivity values. Based on the sequence (1790.5 > 384.0 > 73.0; 384.0 > 73.0 < 103.4; 73.0 < 103.4 < 540.2; 103.4 < 540.2 > 520.8), the correct curve-type is QHAK.

